  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia One UN Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ethiopia One UN Fund was established in 2011 as a funding mechanism for new resources pooled by donors to support underfunded portions of the One UN Programme, including  gender empowerment, maternal health, and equitable development. The Fund seeks to strengthen the planning and coordination progress, align funding to the needs of the UNDAF, and the highest priority needs of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
